OL,3,AHealey's Budget needs to sustain the
OL,4,Astronger economy through gathering
OL,5,Aclouds
OL,6,
OL,7,FHealey's Budget needs to sustain the
OL,8,Fstronger economy through gathering
OL,9,Fclouds
OL,11,FThere have been almost no Budget leaks.
OL,13,FThe chancellor's aides are using
OL,14,Fintelligence-style security measures to
OL,15,Fguard its secrets: the Budget has been
OL,16,Fsplit into "compartments" with very few
OL,17,Fgiven access to all of them. There are
OL,18,Fcodenames. The IT has been locked down
OL,19,Fand ministers viewing the plans have to
OL,20,Fsign a digital promise not to brief
OL,21,Fmedia.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
